                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A simple fill-in-the-letters flashcard game where you must identify the animals shown in the photos and spell the animal's name correctly. It starts off rather easy and gets harder and harder as you go. Achievements are earned for each correct answer. If you're stuck, there are some cheats you can earn to help nudge you along in solving the puzzle. \n\nThe game is played in a vertical orientation, giving the impression that it is a port of a mobile phone game.\n\nThe player will learn new animals as well as brushing up on their spelling. The game can be played in multiple languages for added difficulty and educational value. Appropriate for players of all ages.",
